Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.85,0:01:20.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.26,0:01:24.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.86,0:01:26.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.68,0:01:29.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.62,0:01:32.06,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.11,0:01:33.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.89,0:01:38.94,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.15,0:01:40.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.51,0:01:42.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,1570,1670)}{\t(500,550,\fscx125\fscy60)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.06,0:01:42.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\move(960,1040,960,1065,1020,1120)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.77,0:01:44.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.60,0:01:46.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.52,0:01:50.21,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,3590,3690)}{\t(2130,2180,\fscx125\fscy60)}我们浴火而生在当下
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.70,0:01:49.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\pos(960,1040)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.02,0:01:51.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\move(960,1040,960,1065,90,190)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.89,0:01:53.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们浴火而生
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}前往下片天地
